#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: docs/features/companion.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Desktop Companion"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/features/companion.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "桌面伴侣（Companion）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **Dynamic SAP 卫星**：单体桌面 GUI 应用，不经 `config.yaml` managed 托管。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:10
msgid ""
"桌面伴侣是运行在用户桌面上的 SAP **Type B** 应用（主进程持 Hub WebSocket、"
"`relay: false`）：Electron 透明壳 + 主进程内嵌 Node.js HTTP/SAP 服务，通过 "
"SAP 向 Hub 注册在线实例，并向 Agent 注册本地工具。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "架构"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/features/companion.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"用户桌面（单体 Electron 应用）\n"
"├── Main Process — Node.js HTTP + SAP + 托盘/窗口管理\n"
"│   ├── companion 窗 — 透明置顶，VRM 渲染、文字气泡、本地交互\n"
"│   └── settings 窗 — 普通有边框窗口，从托盘打开\n"
"└── Renderer — 通过 preload 桥接 IPC，API 走 localhost\n"
"         ↕ SAP WS（可跨机）\n"
"    anima service Hub → Agent 可调用 companion 工具\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:24
msgid "与 Parlor / 结对编程的区别："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|             | Parlor / 结对编程            | Companion                                    |\n"
"| ----------- | ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| UI          | 浏览器 Web UI                | 原生透明伴侣窗 + 独立设置窗                  |\n"
"| 部署        | Managed（可与 service 同机） | Dynamic（用户自行启动）                      |\n"
"| SAP         | Type A 或 Type B + relay     | Type B + tools，无 relay                     |\n"
"| 客户端与 UI | 可分离                       | 伴侣渲染与设置窗分离，同属一个 Electron 应用 |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "功能"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:42
msgid ""
"VRM 角色渲染（Three.js + `@pixiv/three-vrm`）；VRM 1.0 与 0.x 自动校正朝向"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:42
msgid ""
"**动作槽位（Motion Slot）**：`idle`、`rest`、`walk`、`climb`、`in_place` 五个"
"槽位；每槽位可绑定 0..n 个 VRMA，播放时指定或随机；槽位为空则不播放动画"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:42
msgid ""
"**文字气泡**：单向文字队列；用户点击切换下一条，不自动消失；由 Hub Agent 通"
"过 `companion.bubble` 工具推送"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:42
msgid "透明置顶 companion 窗（160×260）+ 角色区域可点、空白穿透"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:42
msgid ""
"**本地交互**：拖拽移动窗口；点击身体任意部位从 `in_place` 槽位随机播放动作"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:42
msgid ""
"**巡逻**（可在设置 → 行为 Tab 配置）：空闲自动巡逻、双击巡逻、角点停顿、巡逻"
"速度、启动归位等"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:42
msgid "系统托盘：显示/隐藏伴侣、打开设置、退出"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:42
msgid "设置窗 Tab：**通用** / **行为** / **模型** / **动作槽位** / **动作库**"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Agent 工具（sidecar 注册）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:49
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Mode    | Route / URL                         | Role                                      |\n"
#| "| ------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Parlor  | `http://127.0.0.1:4174` (satellite) | Chat with the agent                       |\n"
#| "| Chamber | `/chamber/*` on Hub                 | Memory, config, tools, system maintenance |\n"
msgid ""
"| 工具        | 参数                                 | 说明                           |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------ |\n"
"| `bubble`    | `text: string`                       | 文字入气泡队列                 |\n"
"| `play_slot` | `slot: string`；`motion_id?: string` | 播放动作槽位；`motion_id` 可选 |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 模式     | 路由 / URL                          | 角色                                      |\n"
"| -------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 会客厅   | `http://127.0.0.1:4174`（satellite） | 与 Agent 对话                             |\n"
"| 卧室     | Hub 上 `/chamber/*`                 | 记忆、配置、工具与系统维护                |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:51
msgid ""
"定时笑话等周期性内容在 **anima service / 定时任务** 侧配置，由 Agent 调用 "
"`bubble` 推送；Companion 不内置定时器。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "模型与动作"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:55
msgid ""
"仓库**不捆绑** `.vrm` / `.vrma` 文件。配置持久化在 `~/.anima/companion/"
"config.json`（含 `models`、`motion_library`、`motion_slots`、`behavior`）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "VRM 模型"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:59
msgid ""
"在设置 → **模型** Tab：列表、导入、删除、重命名、切换当前模型。文件保存到 "
"`~/.anima/companion/models/`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:61
msgid "开发期可将文件放入 `satellites/companion/public/models/` 作为回退目录。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "VRMA 动作库与槽位"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:65
msgid ""
"在设置 → **动作库** Tab 导入 VRMA 动作包 ZIP 或单个文件；在 **动作槽位** Tab "
"为各槽位勾选动作。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:67
msgid ""
"动作文件目录：`~/.anima/companion/motions/`。未绑定槽位时不播放对应动画；巡逻"
"位移仍会平移窗口，仅在有 `walk` / `climb` VRMA 时播放移动动画。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "开发与运行"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "浏览器开发（无需 Electron）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:72
