"bun satellites/companion/dev.ts\n"
"# 伴侣：http://127.0.0.1:4176\n"
"# 设置：页面内「设置」按钮打开面板弹窗（非独立路由）\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "Electron 桌面壳"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd satellites/companion\n"
"bun install\n"
"bun dev:electron\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:87
msgid "打包："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bun build:windows:installer   # Windows NSIS（可在 Linux 交叉构建）\n"
"bun build:macos:release       # macOS DMG（须在 macOS 上执行）\n"
"bun build:windows             # 快速：仅 release/win-unpacked/，无安装包\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:95
msgid ""
"Linux 上打 Windows 安装包时，electron-builder 默认会用 Wine **运行 stub "
"Setup.exe** 提取 uninstaller（无图形环境常失败）。`build-electron.ts` 在同进"
"程调用 electron-builder 前 patch `WineVmManager`，改用 app-builder-lib 的 "
"`UninstallerReader` 从 PE 解析提取（与 macOS 路径相同），无需 Wine 验证；交叉"
"构建时另设 `CSC_IDENTITY_AUTO_DISCOVERY=false`、`forceCodeSigning: false`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:97
msgid "环境变量："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:103
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Variable                                  | Role                                           |\n"
#| "| ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| `FREEANIMA_URL`                           | Hub HTTP base URL                              |\n"
#| "| `SATELLITE_PORT`                          | Satellite HTTP listen port                     |\n"
#| "| `SATELLITE_INSTANCE_ID`                   | Stable instance id (optional; random if unset) |\n"
